  "text": "They still need to be updated for a full v5 -> v6 migration.\n\n- `public/app/features/playlist/PlaylistEditPage.tsx` is **not migrated** yet:\n  - It imports `useParams` from `react-router-dom-v5-compat`.\n  - It uses `locationService.push(...)` for navigation.\n\n```1:2:public/app/features/playlist/PlaylistEditPage.tsx\nimport { useParams } from 'react-router-dom-v5-compat';\n```\n\n```21:27:public/app/features/playlist/PlaylistEditPage.tsx\n  const onSubmit = async (playlist: Playlist) => {\n    replacePlaylist({\n      name: playlist.metadata?.name ?? '',\n      playlist,\n    });\n    locationService.push('/playlists');\n  };\n```\n\n- `public/app/features/playlist/PlaylistNewPage.tsx` is also **not fully migrated**:\n  - It doesn’t use v5-compat hooks, but it still uses `locationService.push(...)` instead of v6 `useNavigate`.\n\n```17:22:public/app/features/playlist/PlaylistNewPage.tsx\n  const onSubmit = async (playlist: Playlist) => {\n    await createPlaylist({\n      playlist,\n    });\n    locationService.push('/playlists');\n  };\n```\n\nIf you want, I can outline the exact minimal code changes for both files to match the v6 pattern (no edits, just a patch plan).",
