  "text": "All clean. Here's a summary of what was added:\n\n**Category assignment** (`getCategoryForItem`, lines 30-49) -- Each bookmark is automatically classified by matching its URL and nav ID against configurable pattern lists:\n\n- **Operations** -- `/alerting`, `/connections`, `/monitoring`, `/infrastructure`, and IDs containing `alerting`, `connections`, `monitoring`, `incident`\n- **Admin** -- `/admin`, `/org`, `/plugins`, `/profile`, `/teams`, `/api-keys`, `/serviceaccounts`, and IDs containing `admin`, `cfg`, `plugin`\n- **Content** -- everything else (dashboards, explore, playlists, library panels, etc.)\n\n**Filter pills** (lines 114-126) -- A row of `FilterPill` components at the top lets you toggle between \"All\", \"Operations\", \"Admin\", and \"Content\". Each pill shows the count of bookmarks in that category.\n\n**Grouped sections** (lines 134-148) -- When \"All\" is selected, bookmarks appear grouped under labeled section headings. When a specific category is selected, only that group is shown. An `EmptyState` is displayed if the selected category has no bookmarks.\n\nAll existing behavior (empty state for zero bookmarks, `NavLandingPageCard` rendering, `usePinnedItems` + `findByUrl` lookup) is preserved.",
